Cell["Improved MLP with 5/20 neurons per liner layer", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9316915448593273`*^9, 
  3.9316915529411545`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6db2d4bf-4a62-cf4e-a3b5-\
